ir control. (Source: Wikipedia)","totalMediaCount":2784,"slug":"thriller","nsfw":false,"childCount":0},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/159/manga"}}}},{"id":"58","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:38:48.922Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:30:58.730Z","title":"Time Travel","description":"In time travel anime characters are transported through time either figuratively or literally to find themselves either in the past or the future","totalMediaCount":576,"slug":"time-travel","nsfw":false,"childCount":0},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/58/manga"}}}},{"id":"128","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/128"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:39:08.523Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:30:58.291Z","title":"Plot Continuity","description":"Consis